Copyright 2026 Cesar Marolla

This product includes software originally developed by Cesar Marolla
(ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8498-7380), an interactive reference
implementation of the Risk Mechanism Theory Index (RMTI) for urban,
infrastructure and disaster-risk assessment, developed for ENVR E-241
"Risk by Design," Harvard University, Division of Continuing Education.

Companion Python reference implementation:
  https://github.com/drmarolla/Risk-Mechanism-Theory-Index-RMTI-
  Concept DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21445892

Software citation: see CITATION.cff. Concept DOI for this sandbox (always
resolves to the latest release): https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22909081

Educational and research use only. An independent academic tool; not an
official product of the World Bank Group or any other institution. Scores
are relative, rubric-based indices, not forecasts, engineering assessments,
or actuarial figures.

